.TH "SKARN-STATS" "1" "2026-06-23" "skarn 0.23.0" "Skarn Manual"
.SH NAME
skarn\-stats \- Session analytics: tokens, models, tools, and timing (text,
json, csv, or html)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskarn\fR \fBstats\fR [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Session analytics: tokens, models, tools, and timing (text, json, csv, or
html).
.PP
Session analytics. A positional session id switches to a per\-session view.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-cli\fR \fIname\fR
Restrict to one assistant's sessions. One of: claude, gemini, codex, cursor,
copilot, kimi.
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fIpath\fR
Restrict to matching projects: a comma\-separated list of names or paths, each
matched case\-insensitively against a session's project display name, its
canonical root path, or a parent directory of that root.
.TP
\fB\-\-worktree\fR \fIpath\fR
Restrict to sessions whose working directory is under this path.
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fIdate\fR
Lower bound of the time window; takes priority over \-\-hours.
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fIdate\fR
Upper bound of the time window.
.TP
\fB\-\-tz\-offset\fR \fIminutes\fR
Timezone offset in minutes for date grouping and display. The default is 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-hours\fR \fIn\fR
Time window in hours; 0 means no limit. The default is 168.
.TP
\fB\-\-session\fR \fIid\fR
Restrict to a single session by id (prefix\-matched).
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fIfmt\fR
Output format. csv requires \-\-by; html writes a file (\-o). One of: text,
json, csv, html. The default is text.
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fIaxis\fR
Group the aggregate by date or project; required for \-\-format csv. One of:
date, project.
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fIlist\fR
Comma list of content blocks to render (default: overview,tokens). text and
html only. One of: overview, tokens, models, tools, timing, all.
.TP
\fB\-\-open\fR
Open the HTML report in a browser after writing it (\-\-format html only).
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fIfile\fR
Destination file for \-\-format html. The default is skarn\-report.html.
